@startuml
title 3A - Linear: a ticket is assigned to Jardinero\nThe single door through which ticket work starts

skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Human
participant Linear
participant "LinearAdapter" as LA
participant "Orchestrator" as O
participant "Store" as S
participant "SandboxPool" as P
participant "WorkerRunner\n(sandbox)" as R
participant GitHub

Human -> Linear: delegate the issue to Jardinero
Linear -> LA: AgentSessionEvent/created
LA -> O: LinearRequest{subject=linear:<issue>, actor, session}
O -> S: take the ask about this ticket, or create one
return rr_resolved
note right of O: a ticket delegated from Discord already has one, see 1A
O -> S: create LinearImplementer instance in the repository this delivery resolves
return li_pending
O -> S: consume the ask, stamping the repository the work opened in
O -> Linear: move issue to in-progress

O -> P: enqueue SandboxRun(LinearImplementer)
O -> S: state
return li_implementing
P -> R: execute
R -> GitHub: push branch + open DRAFT PR
return pr_url
R -> P: result{pr_url, branch, cost}
P -> O: run finished
O -> S: store pr_url + branch
return li_verifying
O -> Linear: post activity + link PR

O -> P: enqueue SandboxRun(LinearVerifier)
P -> R: execute
R -> R: read criteria + branch diff, run the gate and tests
R -> P: verdict{accept|reject, criteria[], issues[]}
P -> O: run finished

alt accept, and no pending human input
  O -> GitHub: mark the PR ready for review
  O -> Linear: move issue to in-review
  O -> S: state
  return li_waiting_pr
  O -> S: create PrMaintainer instance
  return prm_pending
  note right of O
    internal handoff, no waiting for the poll.
    Hourly: read the PR. Merged -> li_done, closed -> li_abandoned.
  end note
else reject, iterations left
  O -> P: enqueue SandboxRun(LinearImplementer, revising)
  O -> S: state
  return li_implementing
else reject, no iterations left
  O -> Linear: post elicitation
  O -> S: state
  return li_needs_human (open, resumable)
end
@enduml
